      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Наконец друзья добрались до археологического музея на Руне.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4240,
      "sha256": "01df0ce72106dea963caedc25df3522312f9d1faeedf67df7c4fa96ef0766b98"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Профессор решил составить Мике компанию.",
      "emotion_tag": "[lightly]",
      "duration_ms": 2800,
      "sha256": "b1768b9d89cf3ddab53a6a83970bec918c88eec55eda7bac37afa876b99feb96"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Мика, взгляни! Похоже на череп небольшого хищного динозавра!",
      "emotion_tag": "[fascinated]",
      "duration_ms": 4720,
      "sha256": "b0a0486a48e0a312c5e8481ff9899c0ae622d2e889c30f8ccda53203ed4a1d19"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Вау!",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 1280,
      "sha256": "91729b6a044b9c0f0432d4946f8120e67b461c292a4002cabd373c4b5430fc98"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F03",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Встреча профессоров…",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 2080,
      "sha256": "c86dd94fe2f9150e9787b8c944e6724bfe896ce5a8288dbee7ccfa6244e8eb3e"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F03",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Рад познакомиться, коллега!",
      "emotion_tag": "[friendly]",
      "duration_ms": 2000,
      "sha256": "fa02aa0f0d885ffabae427626018feb8d322188e819b200d923562829f7ae179"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L007",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F04",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "…как всегда, закончилась спором!",
      "emotion_tag": "[wryly]",
      "duration_ms": 2960,
      "sha256": "8df8b6b543616621fdeb0c7be08802bf029a94d1069e6c1e33840cc6b045da7a"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L008_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L008",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F05",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Учёные предположили: удар астероида не оборвал древнюю ветвь эволюции. Следы земной жизни могли попасть в другую галактику, смешаться с местными видами и дать начало необычному гибриду — предку ящеров.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 14240,
      "sha256": "9708b940fc2f284cc67c2adb6505ab2f64404910a11cde9b1742739b6ae5a497"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L009_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L009",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F06",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Редкий случай: учёные всё-таки нашли компромисс!",
      "emotion_tag": "[amused]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "2078fd817354803d9c6a61aaf6406f7e4560fb4673c946f09b75a3ea7ac63830"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L010_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L010",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "На раскопках мы обнаружили следы древней расы. Похоже, она умела управлять гравитацией!",
      "emotion_tag": "[with scientific wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "sha256": "7385f04132bc993dfb1f434b1df0dea62dd2ffcb8107c6431dab05be113475e2"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L011_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L011",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Возможно, именно её знания помогут тебе разгадать тайну шторма, Мика.",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously, hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "fbbb6e02f6d9a63af46fca2f23fcfc395fea3b21cb0cc35053c212df7d82e68b"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P05_L012_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L012",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_008",
      "role": "ship_navigation",
      "kind": "system",
      "voice_id": "SAz9YHcvj6GT2YYXdXww",
      "text": "НОВЫЙ КУРС: АНДРОМЕДА",
      "emotion_tag": "[clear and informative]",
      "duration_ms": 2480,
      "sha256": "aa0ebc98c8bfc1da9d783475c7c27cae69265620241f8ff3762567d7f025a9b3"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "At last, our friends arrived at the archaeological museum on Runa.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4720,
      "sha256": "c76f24663ba36181d5703fd364c8531bb8fd741520f8b13cf099151a723c5795"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "The professor decided to join Mika for a look around.",
      "emotion_tag": "[lightly]",
      "duration_ms": 3440,
      "sha256": "cbff73e814927b37be1193c944b8705dad8a272797e433e208e6ea36c8936ff9"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Mika, look! A skull like that of a small predatory dinosaur!",
      "emotion_tag": "[fascinated]",
      "duration_ms": 4800,
      "sha256": "d7c8d71123bebda5b79378899c56f60c8546e75c19f4963df6f07bd9828930e5"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Wow!",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 1200,
      "sha256": "55be017030af666d85ff27ec8c3eb35387f8bc17d8b8dff2706e856d583e38cf"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F03",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "When two professors meet…",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "sha256": "e870188656768e1be16fda8d32fd78520b3060e95521799357f12674745af384"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F03",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "A pleasure to meet you, colleague!",
      "emotion_tag": "[friendly]",
      "duration_ms": 2160,
      "sha256": "f52764cfb4d1cff1e4c559d565de6f4b62aaf1f8a5208f01c05d5bdd34527897"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L007",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F04",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "…a debate is never far behind!",
      "emotion_tag": "[wryly]",
      "duration_ms": 2720,
      "sha256": "73ae2738a25e607ffd43f8a48e93402cf8da156148a7b12406e222fabffacd1a"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L008_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L008",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F05",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "The scientists had a theory: the asteroid may not have ended that ancient evolutionary branch. Traces of life from Earth could have reached another galaxy, mingled with local species and given rise to an unusual hybrid—the ancestor of the lizards.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 16240,
      "sha256": "3a51c4b8d0067037194b263c3a1a7a347cc06286a77681f7dc3101fe5ee19eb2"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L009_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L009",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F06",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "For once, the scientists actually reached an agreement!",
      "emotion_tag": "[amused]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "c75e532ddf9dd9044ad2cc342e6d8273ae1730024607e7e4f6ee0a742a083ca9"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L010_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L010",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Our excavations uncovered traces of an ancient people. It seems they could control gravity!",
      "emotion_tag": "[with scientific wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 6080,
      "sha256": "63907e7a2ff11175bca8bf990e9f13a0cdf422ada7e9fc43aa4e63b07adc4a0a"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L011_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L011",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Perhaps their knowledge will help you solve the mystery of the storm, Mika.",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously, hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "sha256": "9ab549a009632f9b605f682115a777d901dfb66320a4bd47e94a58ba009efe2d"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P05_L012_en.mp3",
