      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Os cientistas levantaram uma hipótese: o asteroide talvez não tenha encerrado aquela antiga linhagem evolutiva. Vestígios de vida da Terra podem ter chegado a outra galáxia, se misturado a espécies locais e dado origem a um híbrido incomum — o ancestral dos lagartos.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 16880,
      "sha256": "ed7cbbafbb500e8a7dd8376e819b743a399139a697ce2e57e96ae833a79d7957"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH04_P05_L009_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L009",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F06",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Por incrível que pareça, os cientistas chegaram a um acordo!",
      "emotion_tag": "[amused]",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "sha256": "60e0c8908418cc972a0b35dfcf04d7b57b26f98d03f8c13b6b36ec9dde79e286"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH04_P05_L010_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L010",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Nas escavações, encontramos vestígios de um povo antigo. Parece que ele sabia controlar a gravidade!",
      "emotion_tag": "[with scientific wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 6880,
      "sha256": "f40a8fbb3b8c7ddb263998ffd07bcd81f82e11dc92e9d0195ec7ad5375e55da4"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH04_P05_L011_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L011",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Talvez o conhecimento desse povo ajude você a desvendar o mistério da tempestade, Mika.",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously, hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "sha256": "21dcdfcea3798e9d9bcea56b73b3d16f78e320538171db12a00d498195398429"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH04_P05_L012_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L012",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_008",
      "role": "ship_navigation",
      "kind": "system",
      "voice_id": "SAz9YHcvj6GT2YYXdXww",
      "text": "NOVO DESTINO: ANDRÔMEDA",
      "emotion_tag": "[clear and informative]",
      "duration_ms": 2480,
      "sha256": "0d39ee237c5e99a39def12a46f6d1253956219cb728eee87a6b29a4b995d0c67"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L001",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Por fin, nuestros amigos llegaron al museo arqueológico de Runa.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "sha256": "a2589d6462ae4a35657af5650a07a8033647aea982a07f73a046a0dd41a3262d"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "El profesor decidió acompañar a Mika en la visita.",
      "emotion_tag": "[lightly]",
      "duration_ms": 3120,
      "sha256": "23d74a75f7e82303fe468876eeb321ea126de81e563f6db357c7cfff548f5785"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "¡Mika, mira! ¡Parece el cráneo de un pequeño dinosaurio carnívoro!",
      "emotion_tag": "[fascinated]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "sha256": "9f4a775a73674ade34a24a4327dbf07384be0262e69e3f5ce5ce425ffeaf4821"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "¡Guau!",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 1120,
      "sha256": "3367bef1b1991b94d7a00fa83357a22cb76a5873eb4787e25b1e094382ed120f"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L005",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F03",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Cuando dos profesores se encuentran…",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 2720,
      "sha256": "dcf1f3b9f49638e83d2a7820cfa6589162b45bde84030de2745cb4e4f02b13f0"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F03",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "…¡encantado de conocerlo, colega!",
      "emotion_tag": "[friendly]",
      "duration_ms": 2400,
      "sha256": "080567d7b18ac54d7f0fdc04e5ee5492d551acb51324934d6053e37e900f0b8c"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L007",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F04",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "…¡la discusión está asegurada!",
      "emotion_tag": "[wryly]",
      "duration_ms": 2640,
      "sha256": "926e957be5fab09d4eda884af3ff1f7269dc26b98b2fe2a931b81c6ee07f8c7d"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L008_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L008",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F05",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Los científicos plantearon una hipótesis: quizá el asteroide no acabó con aquella antigua rama evolutiva. Algunos restos de vida terrestre pudieron llegar a otra galaxia, mezclarse con especies locales y dar origen a un híbrido singular: el antepasado de los lagartos.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 17040,
      "sha256": "6ea65b0fd6934c4aca1903530d111ff36b932748f634e88883ec25ef09f4b95b"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L009_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L009",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F06",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "¡Por una vez, los científicos lograron ponerse de acuerdo!",
      "emotion_tag": "[amused]",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "sha256": "e47321858e6c05f91240a6908a1622e0aebc3eecfb8fe4feb73957a692f41599"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L010_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L010",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "En nuestras excavaciones hallamos huellas de un pueblo antiguo. ¡Parece que podía controlar la gravedad!",
      "emotion_tag": "[with scientific wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "sha256": "bd5bd7de53093590e0e5ab4b892132844ab9f68dc17ef37851159ba79bf0fb47"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L011_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L011",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Quizá sus conocimientos te ayuden a desentrañar el misterio de la tormenta, Mika.",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously, hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 4960,
      "sha256": "bb15e0ec3d557e49a5d8227ed4ccd52871ff9d37815a7b7527af13ccb00001c2"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P05_L012_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L012",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_008",
      "role": "ship_navigation",
      "kind": "system",
      "voice_id": "SAz9YHcvj6GT2YYXdXww",
      "text": "NUEVO RUMBO: ANDRÓMEDA",
      "emotion_tag": "[clear and informative]",
      "duration_ms": 2400,
      "sha256": "af673e2f591d4992d5743e1f5c460fcf4f73c4c5a67c183248207984286e5973"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Enfin, nos amis arrivèrent au musée archéologique de Runa.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "3e51b7d3de719611d0b962a4f139daa4982b184e5c6858e49996853faee3c41f"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Le professeur décida d’accompagner Mika pour la visite.",
      "emotion_tag": "[lightly]",
      "duration_ms": 3280,
      "sha256": "bd227160e6443fbeb99dd0ca2ef1d930bf6b20dbb6ed869217ee3d43e00c3040"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Mika, regarde ! On dirait le crâne d’un petit dinosaure carnivore !",
      "emotion_tag": "[fascinated]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "sha256": "95b529f7de07473b7ffdb893848d2bff5cc638f405b174ebbe1e0211cac86d59"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Waouh !",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 1280,
      "sha256": "d06f9c2a0b2dd171a198a386e16ffb4ef9b49b19731817ba65ae4578507c0314"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F03",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Quand deux professeurs se rencontrent…",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 2560,
      "sha256": "d06d749eb61b58693608a0e8ee2afc9b039cba5318c63dc229017e68aea5a8ec"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F03",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Ravi de vous rencontrer, cher collègue !",
      "emotion_tag": "[friendly]",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "sha256": "1857e9591fc35f4612b4742f074f65a443d9db8ab7c37e7adc6483a899ae7038"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L007",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F04",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "…la discussion tourne vite au débat !",
      "emotion_tag": "[wryly]",
      "duration_ms": 2720,
      "sha256": "548c1e2b46c3e5af2d6e14eb2eb0598bfcf0897bc44148153be104d0610cbbe7"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L008_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L008",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F05",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Les chercheurs avancèrent une hypothèse : l’astéroïde n’avait peut-être pas mis fin à cette ancienne lignée. Des traces de vie terrestre auraient pu atteindre une autre galaxie, se mêler aux espèces locales et donner naissance à un hybride étonnant : l’ancêtre des lézards.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 15120,
      "sha256": "e29f0b115223091cdec0e79c0c4187a308c45cf0147f192953baefc11b6c41f5"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L009_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L009",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F06",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Pour une fois, les chercheurs parvinrent à se mettre d’accord !",
      "emotion_tag": "[amused]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "17be56933f28d3bdbf6a51b704a1f7e21dcf644f0926704a2caedb735a038e13"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L010_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L010",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Nos fouilles ont révélé les traces d’un peuple ancien. Il aurait su maîtriser la gravité !",
      "emotion_tag": "[with scientific wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 5520,
      "sha256": "01543aae832e72bd9e1203c31aa7bbc635d7e9442c2aca3faeeda628b9c743c9"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L011_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L011",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Peut-être que son savoir t’aidera à percer le mystère de la tempête, Mika.",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously, hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 4240,
      "sha256": "6c5652a908c48b7e47fd4d386ca013bafc7eef0d8c6cf51c5b4482bffc990632"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P05_L012_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L012",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_008",
      "role": "ship_navigation",
      "kind": "system",
      "voice_id": "SAz9YHcvj6GT2YYXdXww",
      "text": "NOUVEAU CAP : ANDROMÈDE",
      "emotion_tag": "[clear and informative]",
      "duration_ms": 2160,
      "sha256": "0f6d033331d4343f87fa0b700977c59e660724764f3ebecf1fab63dcfdb060b0"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P05_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Endlich erreichten unsere Freunde das archäologische Museum auf Runa.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "sha256": "f7556cda21fff864fe64737b8505af762bedd3f9c4f43f37389af66637f0e339"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P05_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Der Professor beschloss, Mika bei der Besichtigung zu begleiten.",
      "emotion_tag": "[lightly]",
      "duration_ms": 3840,
      "sha256": "7e726d15264606b8c681de5547ad97c2c6f972bb294ad8ec7be548ac8b710ede"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P05_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Mika, sieh nur! Der Schädel erinnert an einen kleinen Raubdinosaurier!",
      "emotion_tag": "[fascinated]",
      "duration_ms": 5360,
      "sha256": "f01e41edc762c3652c8d405ad7837c3ea579eddfb0818de5fafc2be03ffa257e"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P05_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F02",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Wow!",
      "emotion_tag": "[surprised]",
      "duration_ms": 1200,
