      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Wenn zwei Professoren sich treffen …",
      "emotion_tag": "[playfully]",
      "duration_ms": 2640,
      "sha256": "3efcba0602ebc22bf72bc69852ec580d47e63cb6a653de9de5b19418973eb388"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P05_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F03",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Freut mich, Sie kennenzulernen, Kollege!",
      "emotion_tag": "[friendly]",
      "duration_ms": 2720,
      "sha256": "dffd54eb7504484695d06f3adb65e156a379d651aa316e1cb279f30663d8db33"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P05_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L007",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F04",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "…ist ein Streitgespräch meist nicht weit!",
      "emotion_tag": "[wryly]",
      "duration_ms": 2960,
      "sha256": "986c1cf5c3daa3871d7fa7fe4a5ab66a6b19717ac793bfa070efca8b30d9302e"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P05_L008_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L008",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F05",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Die Forscher hatten eine Vermutung: Der Asteroid könnte diesen alten Evolutionszweig doch nicht völlig beendet haben. Spuren irdischen Lebens könnten eine andere Galaxie erreicht, sich mit heimischen Arten vermischt und einen ungewöhnlichen Mischling hervorgebracht haben — den Vorfahren der Echsen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[thoughtfully]",
      "duration_ms": 17920,
      "sha256": "7b838b0c08b2805bede6ad11259611d2e18882e8a9d9201ddc63bc8df999aea2"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P05_L009_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L009",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F06",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Kaum zu glauben: Die Forscher konnten sich einigen!",
      "emotion_tag": "[amused]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "594f5bda4dcf3e1acb5ece58c808ca29e7ad03809024a11a20c4f8206e896a1a"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P05_L010_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L010",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Bei Ausgrabungen fanden wir Spuren eines uralten Volkes. Offenbar konnte es die Schwerkraft beherrschen!",
      "emotion_tag": "[with scientific wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 6960,
      "sha256": "ce972caa71635cbcbdec64e7b733b5bf06e40d5d3db45d0bd7799a88b817d9f8"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P05_L011_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P05_L011",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P05_F07",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_033",
      "role": "runa_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "VQUUw0Trz8Naf1fKmQ3W",
      "text": "Vielleicht hilft dir sein Wissen, das Geheimnis des Sturms zu lösen, Mika.",
      "emotion_tag": "[mysteriously, hopeful]",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "sha256": "e24a0a0394a64adaab9ae6fdf0395c5c28494f3b06fcb06d0395b055ccb18df3"
